  "getToKnowMe": {
    "description": "<p>*Some of Elizabeth's sales do not show on Zillow and/or appear out of order etc -for a complete list of her sales and all information - contact Elizabeth directly*</p>\n<p>Cell: (805) 279-0727 Email: KammenHomes@gmail.com</p>\n<p>Elizabeth services home buyers and sellers throughout Ventura &amp; Los Angeles Counties. Elizabeth prides herself in consistently saving her buyers money on their purchase &amp; selling her listings for top dollar. In addition to her proven sales skills, she has demonstrated highly effective communications ability. Taken together, her sales and communications talents enable her to do the best job possible for her real estate clients, and to provide a level of quality they not only expect but also deserve. Elizabeth will not only thoroughly understand your wants and needs, but also communicate them effectively. If you or someone you know is planning to buy, sell, or invest in real estate in the near future, or if you simply need information on the current real estate market, please don't hesitate to contact Elizabeth.</p>\n",
    "facebookUrl": "http://www.facebook.com/kammenhomes",
