        "reviewComment": "Elizabeth was absolutely amazing to work with! As first-time homebuyers, my husband and I had so many questions, and she was patient, kind, and always willing to explain every detail in a way that made sense. She never rushed us and was always on top of the market, making sure we had the best options in front of us.\n\nWhat really stood out was how much she went above and beyond. Her strong connections in the real estate industry are the reason our offer was accepted even though there was a higher offer on the table. That alone speaks volumes about her professionalism and reputation!\n\nElizabeth was available whenever we needed her, whether it was a quick call or text, and she made the entire process so smooth and stress-free. She truly cared about making sure we found the right home, and now we not only have a house we love but also feel like we’ve gained a friend.\n\nI couldn’t recommend her enough to anyone looking to buy or sell a home. She is the kind of agent who makes such a big difference in this process, and I’ll be telling all my friends and family to work with her!",
