        "createDate": "2025-07-28T21:15:00",
        "rating": 5,
        "rebuttal": null,
        "reviewComment": "I first met Elizabeth when she represented the buyer for the sale of my home—and I was so impressed with her professionalism, communication, and attention to detail that I chose her to represent me as my agent when it was time to buy a new home in Ventura County.\n\nShe helped me find the perfect place in Camarillo and made the entire process seamless. Elizabeth was incredibly responsive—always answering my questions within minutes—and had trusted inspectors and resources at her fingertips. When we toured homes, she knew exactly what to look for and quickly identified any potential red flags that might need further investigation.\n\nShe’s sharp, experienced, and fun to work with. I truly enjoyed the home-hunting process with her and will absolutely work with her again on future purchases. Highly recommended!",
