        "rebuttal": null,
        "reviewComment": "Elizabeth was amazing from the get-go!  We randomly met at an Open House I stopped at before I had \"officially\" started shopping for a condo and realized that she had lived around the corner from me and my family and had gone to school with my son!  I knew that was a sign that she would be my agent when was I was ready to buy.  Honestly I don't know how she does it because she's ALWAYS available by text or phone call.  She even responded to me when she was out of the country on vacation!!  She is incredibly communicative and knowledgeable on everything real estate in the Conejo Valley and beyond.  I'm thrilled to now be living in a beautiful condo that I wouldn't have if it wasn't for Elizabeth's help, knowledge and support!",
